<title>UK: Israel sets $200 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Israel sets $200 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ISRAEL</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD  AROUND 50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
